      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/la-joya-tx",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Great Depression halted La Joya’s growth, leaving its municipal government dormant until 1965 when Leo J. revived it.",
